### File Inconsistencies API Requests
### Data Processor Service - Port 8002

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8002
@token = {{auth_token}}

### Get all file inconsistencies (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get file inconsistencies with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?file_id=1&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get file inconsistencies by error type
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?error_type=data_validation&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get file inconsistencies for specific line
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?file_id=1&line_number=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inconsistencies for specific file
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inconsistencies for specific file with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/1?error_type=missing_columns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inconsistencies for specific file and line
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/1?line_number=10&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get file inconsistencies summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/summary/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get summary for file that may not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/summary/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?limit=10&offset=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test invalid error type (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?error_type=invalid_type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test large limit (should be capped at 1000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/file-inconsistencies/?limit=2000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}